//! Integration test: compare ferrum_core descriptors against RDKit reference values.
//!
//! The reference CSV is generated by `scripts/generate_rdkit_reference.py` using RDKit.
//! Run `python3 scripts/generate_rdkit_reference.py` from the repo root to regenerate.
//!
//! This test is diagnostic: it prints a detailed comparison report showing which
//! descriptors match RDKit and which differ, with tolerance levels.


//! ## File guide: Rdkit Comparison
//!
//! This file belongs to FerrumChem's **integration/diagnostic validation layer**.
//!
//! What to learn here:
