//! - How Rust types and control-flow encode that concern.
//! - Which public symbols are the best entry points for reading/debugging.
//!
//! Key symbols in this file:
//! - `struct ScalarCheck`
//! - `enum ExtractKind`
//! - `struct CompResult`
//! - `fn reference_row_limit`
